(7403171, 1164377, 173844, '<td valign="top">First, wondrous light slanting down across the receding uplands and down into the gorge.  Second, stunning foreground, finely textured and aglow.  Third, nice palette of grays.  And four, good choice of narrow band of sky.  I love that almost imperceptible bit of terrain right and above the foreground cliff face.  How fortunate you were to be here.  One of my two favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'First, wondrous light slanting down across the receding uplands and down into the gorge.  Second, stunning foreground, finely textured and aglow.  Third, nice palette of grays.  And four, good choice of narrow band of sky.  I love that almost imperceptible bit of terrain right and above the foreground cliff face.  How fortunate you were to be here.  One of my two favorites in the challenge.', '2015-09-07 14:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403172, 1165237, 57447, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W conversion fits this well.</td>', 'B&W conversion fits this well.', '2015-09-07 14:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403174, 1164223, 173844, '<td valign="top">Overwhelmingly dear, this butterfly child.  The curved and straight lines balance well in an elegant composition.  Just beautiful.  It makes me happy to look at her.  One of two personal favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'Overwhelmingly dear, this butterfly child.  The curved and straight lines balance well in an elegant composition.  Just beautiful.  It makes me happy to look at her.  One of two personal favorites in the challenge.', '2015-09-07 14:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403180, 1165427, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful dream-like image.  Mesmerizing, fluid movement, of dancers, locale and light.  Interesting effect - pardon my naivete, is it the processing?  In total, powerful and enchanting.</td>', 'Wonderful dream-like image.  Mesmerizing, fluid movement, of dancers, locale and light.  Interesting effect - pardon my naivete, is it the processing?  In total, powerful and enchanting.', '2015-09-07 15:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403182, 1165237, 173844, '<td valign="top">The arresting beauty is a fine combination of a strong foreground, middle-ground and background.  The image depth is spectacular.  The stroller on the beach is almost lovingly situated.  The leading lines and diagonals impart a strong sense of movement, as do the waves and clouds.  Fine image.</td>', 'The arresting beauty is a fine combination of a strong foreground, middle-ground and background.  The image depth is spectacular.  The stroller on the beach is almost lovingly situated.  The leading lines and diagonals impart a strong sense of movement, as do the waves and clouds.  Fine image.', '2015-09-07 15:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403183, 1165360, 173844, '<td valign="top">A lovely, peaceful image.  The colors are not modest but have an easygoing harmony that is quietly settling.  It feels like everyone is preparing for dinner while you''re pensively taking in the moment.</td>', 'A lovely, peaceful image.  The colors are not modest but have an easygoing harmony that is quietly settling.  It feels like everyone is preparing for dinner while you''re pensively taking in the moment.', '2015-09-07 15:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403185, 1165097, 173844, '<td valign="top">A celebration of the wondrous worlds underfoot, too often unnoticed and unappreciated.  Terrific shallow focus and gentle bokeh.  In its modest way, majestic.</td>', 'A celebration of the wondrous worlds underfoot, too often unnoticed and unappreciated.  Terrific shallow focus and gentle bokeh.  In its modest way, majestic.', '2015-09-07 15:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403186, 1165399, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful pose, framing and composition.  It''s as if she''s dancing with the ocean.  What an admirable image!</td>', 'Wonderful pose, framing and composition.  It''s as if she''s dancing with the ocean.  What an admirable image!', '2015-09-07 15:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403188, 1165323, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fabulous, delicate, elegant and quietly startling image.  Suggestively surrealistic, especially with the haunting presence of the person looking in through the right hand window.  An abandoned asylum?  Deeply emotional and moving.</td>', 'Fabulous, delicate, elegant and quietly startling image.  Suggestively surrealistic, especially with the haunting presence of the person looking in through the right hand window.  An abandoned asylum?  Deeply emotional and moving.', '2015-09-07 15:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403191, 1165079, 173844, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sunset colors.  I also like the pinpricks of light on the silhouetted mountain.</td>', 'Gorgeous sunset colors.  I also like the pinpricks of light on the silhouetted mountain.', '2015-09-07 16:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403192, 1165607, 173844, '<td valign="top">Perfectly captured light.  In fact, it has a timeless quality, eternity in a moment.  Their interaction is quite endearing.  The perspective is terrific.</td>', 'Perfectly captured light.  In fact, it has a timeless quality, eternity in a moment.  Their interaction is quite endearing.  The perspective is terrific.', '2015-09-07 16:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403193, 1164909, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait.  I sense deep character and sensitivity in this young man -  I hope that''s so.  Its soft quality is affecting.  I love the bright light spilling over his shoulder.</td>', 'Wonderful portrait.  I sense deep character and sensitivity in this young man -  I hope that''s so.  Its soft quality is affecting.  I love the bright light spilling over his shoulder.', '2015-09-07 16:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403196, 1164176, 173844, '<td valign="top">A fine title for this gorgeous, primal image.  This could be several billion years ago -  but for some uprights on the right background mountain that seem man-made.  I love the orange reflection in the water.</td>', 'A fine title for this gorgeous, primal image.  This could be several billion years ago -  but for some uprights on the right background mountain that seem man-made.  I love the orange reflection in the water.', '2015-09-07 16:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403197, 1165691, 173844, '<td valign="top">A tour de force of day''s beginning.  As such, the centralized tree and structure - though each is subtly off-center - is admirably placed.  The purples and blues are a marvel, a joy.  The low-lying fog completes the embrace.</td>', 'A tour de force of day''s beginning.  As such, the centralized tree and structure - though each is subtly off-center - is admirably placed.  The purples and blues are a marvel, a joy.  The low-lying fog completes the embrace.', '2015-09-07 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403198, 1165459, 173844, '<td valign="top">Magical image which embraces both day and night.  The sense is that anything can happen.  What a beautiful part of the world.</td>', 'Magical image which embraces both day and night.  The sense is that anything can happen.  What a beautiful part of the world.', '2015-09-07 16:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403199, 1165413, 173844, '<td valign="top">Incredible portrait of this heron.  Even though captured in an instant, the feeling of motion explodes off the "page."</td>', 'Incredible portrait of this heron.  Even though captured in an instant, the feeling of motion explodes off the "page."', '2015-09-07 16:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403202, 1165685, 173844, '<td valign="top">The wonderful light lends great delicacy and serenity to this scene.  The colors are also marvelous.</td>', 'The wonderful light lends great delicacy and serenity to this scene.  The colors are also marvelous.', '2015-09-07 16:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403211, 1165691, 35804, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment...What draws me to this is the calmness, the quiet. I''ve walked around in early morning misty meadows and I think that may be one of my favorite things to do. I find the composition appealing also, almost centered but not quite...it just works. This is one of those photographs I wish I could walk into.</td>', 'Coming back to comment...What draws me to this is the calmness, the quiet. I''ve walked around in early morning misty meadows and I think that may be one of my favorite things to do. I find the composition appealing also, almost centered but not quite...it just works. This is one of those photographs I wish I could walk into.', '2015-09-07 17:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403212, 1165169, 35804, '<td valign="top">...8...because you made me laugh!</td>', '...8...because you made me laugh!', '2015-09-07 17:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403214, 1165206, 35804, '<td valign="top">Beautiful warm light and interaction...a nice moment!</td>', 'Beautiful warm light and interaction...a nice moment!', '2015-09-07 17:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403215, 1164394, 35804, '<td valign="top">It''s as if she has sprouted up from the rapids...cool photograph.</td>', 'It''s as if she has sprouted up from the rapids...cool photograph.', '2015-09-07 17:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403216, 1165060, 61396, '<td valign="top">well treated</td>', 'well treated', '2015-09-07 17:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403217, 1165323, 61396, '<td valign="top">nicely composed and processed</td>', 'nicely composed and processed', '2015-09-07 17:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403218, 1165323, 35804, '<td valign="top">I think there''s something, someone looking in the right window...maybe, not sure...but that''s what makes this so cool.</td>', 'I think there''s something, someone looking in the right window...maybe, not sure...but that''s what makes this so cool.', '2015-09-07 17:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403219, 1165684, 61396, '<td valign="top">an Ursula classic</td>', 'an Ursula classic', '2015-09-07 17:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403220, 1165569, 35804, '<td valign="top">It''s so saturated, perhaps overly so, but it works for me...those vibrant layers of color just make me smile.</td>', 'It''s so saturated, perhaps overly so, but it works for me...those vibrant layers of color just make me smile.', '2015-09-07 17:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403222, 1164971, 147314, '<td valign="top">Beautiful still-life!</td>', 'Beautiful still-life!', '2015-09-07 17:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403223, 1165691, 61396, '<td valign="top">a moody blue</td>', 'a moody blue', '2015-09-07 17:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403224, 1165413, 147314, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot. The white on the neck and back is a bit too bright.</td>', 'Nice action shot. The white on the neck and back is a bit too bright.', '2015-09-07 17:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403225, 1165148, 35804, '<td valign="top">The pinnacle of fun! I love the person off to the right, possibly on a phone? Definitely a fun, high energy shot.</td>', 'The pinnacle of fun! I love the person off to the right, possibly on a phone? Definitely a fun, high energy shot.', '2015-09-07 17:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403226, 1165148, 61396, '<td valign="top">an attitude to capture</td>', 'an attitude to capture', '2015-09-07 17:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403227, 1163878, 35804, '<td valign="top">Nice! It''s so strange seeing so many of them outside, not in some cage.</td>', 'Nice! It''s so strange seeing so many of them outside, not in some cage.', '2015-09-07 17:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403228, 1165582, 61396, '<td valign="top">extreme composition and contrast to make a point</td>', 'extreme composition and contrast to make a point', '2015-09-07 17:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403229, 1165238, 35804, '<td valign="top">A really interesting POV and such a pleasing composition.</td>', 'A really interesting POV and such a pleasing composition.', '2015-09-07 17:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403230, 1164394, 61396, '<td valign="top">almost reaching the edge. lovely blacks.</td>', 'almost reaching the edge. lovely blacks.', '2015-09-07 17:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403231, 1165470, 61396, '<td valign="top">extremely reactive</td>', 'extremely reactive', '2015-09-07 17:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403232, 1165104, 147314, '<td valign="top">Not as good as your other shot, but it''s a beautiful place to photograph.</td>', 'Not as good as your other shot, but it''s a beautiful place to photograph.', '2015-09-07 17:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403233, 1164223, 61396, '<td valign="top">a corner trap</td>', 'a corner trap', '2015-09-07 17:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403237, 1164333, 147314, '<td valign="top">Sail Amsterdam... have to go there again next time. Quite a happening. I like the fact you focused on the kids not the ships. Great use of DoF.<br/> <br/>I guess that first ship is the ''Stad Amsterdam'', but what''s that ship behind it?</td>', 'Sail Amsterdam... have to go there again next time. Quite a happening. I like the fact you focused on the kids not the ships. Great use of DoF. I guess that first ship is the ''Stad Amsterdam'', but what''s that ship behind it?', '2015-09-07 18:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403238, 1165685, 147314, '<td valign="top">Lovely scenery. Very much like the Highlands of Scotland.</td>', 'Lovely scenery. Very much like the Highlands of Scotland.', '2015-09-07 18:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403239, 1165571, 147314, '<td valign="top">Great sky and colours</td>', 'Great sky and colours', '2015-09-07 18:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403240, 1165459, 147314, '<td valign="top">Wow, aurora borealis during daylight? Lucky you!</td>', 'Wow, aurora borealis during daylight? Lucky you!', '2015-09-07 18:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403241, 1164889, 61396, '<td valign="top">a puzzling scene</td>', 'a puzzling scene', '2015-09-07 18:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403242, 1165582, 173844, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful. Absolute perfection.  Minimal but not quite understated, since the birds are so dynamic.  The wondrously rendered grain is integral to the sublimely delicate scene, a hint or suggestion.  Feels like an epiphany.</td>', 'Just beautiful. Absolute perfection.  Minimal but not quite understated, since the birds are so dynamic.  The wondrously rendered grain is integral to the sublimely delicate scene, a hint or suggestion.  Feels like an epiphany.', '2015-09-07 18:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403243, 1165567, 147314, '<td valign="top">Some selfie, very nice!</td>', 'Some selfie, very nice!', '2015-09-07 18:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403244, 1165597, 147314, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot of a magnificent bird of prey!</td>', 'Beautiful shot of a magnificent bird of prey!', '2015-09-07 18:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403245, 1165684, 147314, '<td valign="top">Very nice... Bump!</td>', 'Very nice... Bump!', '2015-09-07 18:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403246, 1165694, 147314, '<td valign="top">My favourite birds, love them!</td>', 'My favourite birds, love them!', '2015-09-07 18:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403247, 1165670, 147314, '<td valign="top">Great atmosphere. And great title as well. Bump +2!</td>', 'Great atmosphere. And great title as well. Bump +2!', '2015-09-07 18:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403248, 1165482, 147314, '<td valign="top">Nice pastel colours.</td>', 'Nice pastel colours.', '2015-09-07 18:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403249, 1165106, 147314, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait, great details in it. Really like the processing!</td>', 'Beautiful portrait, great details in it. Really like the processing!', '2015-09-07 18:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403250, 1164641, 147314, '<td valign="top">Nice PoV.</td>', 'Nice PoV.', '2015-09-07 18:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403251, 1165205, 147314, '<td valign="top">Very good of you to insert that lady in this image... really shows the enormity of the pier.</td>', 'Very good of you to insert that lady in this image... really shows the enormity of the pier.', '2015-09-07 18:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403252, 1165674, 147314, '<td valign="top">Lot''s of contrast in this image, I''d rather seen more details in both the highlights and the shadows.</td>', 'Lot''s of contrast in this image, I''d rather seen more details in both the highlights and the shadows.', '2015-09-07 18:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403253, 1165627, 147314, '<td valign="top">Although a funny shot, the processing doesn''t work for me. And that barbed wire is a bit distracting as well.</td>', 'Although a funny shot, the processing doesn''t work for me. And that barbed wire is a bit distracting as well.', '2015-09-07 18:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403255, 1165101, 147314, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scenery, well exposed. Only distracting thing is the white spots between those tree leaves at the top, maybe due to your processing?</td>', 'Beautiful scenery, well exposed. Only distracting thing is the white spots between those tree leaves at the top, maybe due to your processing?', '2015-09-07 18:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403256, 1165628, 147314, '<td valign="top">Composition is a bit boring and although a nice sky there are too many washed out highlights in it. I think the sky could have used some punch!</td>', 'Composition is a bit boring and although a nice sky there are too many washed out highlights in it. I think the sky could have used some punch!', '2015-09-07 18:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403257, 1165654, 147314, '<td valign="top">I think the little boy in action could be a funnier shot. Now I really have to look twice to find that ball.</td>', 'I think the little boy in action could be a funnier shot. Now I really have to look twice to find that ball.', '2015-09-07 18:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403258, 1164909, 147314, '<td valign="top">Nice potrait, but I find that light behind his shoulder quite distracting.</td>', 'Nice potrait, but I find that light behind his shoulder quite distracting.', '2015-09-07 18:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403260, 1165565, 147314, '<td valign="top">Maybe another crop would have improved the image a lot. Now one third of the image is filled with that pipe.</td>', 'Maybe another crop would have improved the image a lot. Now one third of the image is filled with that pipe.', '2015-09-07 18:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403261, 1165619, 147314, '<td valign="top">Really nice attempt to get that shot (I know how difficult it is, had some tries myself), but somehow the image is not catchy for me.</td>', 'Really nice attempt to get that shot (I know how difficult it is, had some tries myself), but somehow the image is not catchy for me.', '2015-09-07 18:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403264, 1165695, 98339, '<td valign="top">Wyoming?</td>', 'Wyoming?', '2015-09-07 18:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403266, 1165670, 9668, '<td valign="top">I would love to see this finish in the top 5. What an incredible capture!</td>', 'I would love to see this finish in the top 5. What an incredible capture!', '2015-09-07 18:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403278, 1165079, 112739, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color control.</td>', 'Beautiful color control.', '2015-09-07 20:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403279, 1165656, 112739, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking image.</td>', 'Breathtaking image.', '2015-09-07 20:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403280, 1165691, 112739, '<td valign="top">So love the low key processing. It keeps that special mood the image has.</td>', 'So love the low key processing. It keeps that special mood the image has.', '2015-09-07 20:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403281, 1164377, 112739, '<td valign="top">Other than a few sensor spots, this hit the mark quite well.</td>', 'Other than a few sensor spots, this hit the mark quite well.', '2015-09-07 20:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403283, 1165459, 35804, '<td valign="top">I love seeing the green of the grasses and trees in contrast with the green of the aurora...I''m so used to looking at these skies above frozen landscapes...very pretty.</td>', 'I love seeing the green of the grasses and trees in contrast with the green of the aurora...I''m so used to looking at these skies above frozen landscapes...very pretty.', '2015-09-07 20:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403291, 1164333, 114285, '<td valign="top">Lovely nostalgic feel to this.</td>', 'Lovely nostalgic feel to this.', '2015-09-07 21:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403293, 1165106, 114285, '<td valign="top">Johnny has very nice happy eyes, underneath all that roughness I''m sure is a very gentle soul.  Really like this one all the best.</td>', 'Johnny has very nice happy eyes, underneath all that roughness I''m sure is a very gentle soul.  Really like this one all the best.', '2015-09-07 21:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403298, 1165644, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice to have fine detail and natural appearing colors, really enjoying the absence of over-processing commonly found in similar images.</td>', 'Nice to have fine detail and natural appearing colors, really enjoying the absence of over-processing commonly found in similar images.', '2015-09-07 21:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403300, 1165684, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good flow, subtle colors. Reminds me of work by Ursula.</td>', 'Good flow, subtle colors. Reminds me of work by Ursula.', '2015-09-07 21:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7403301, 1163982, 69324, '<td valign="top">Hope this gets the appreciation it deserves.</td>', 'Hope this gets the appreciation it deserves.', '2015-09-07 21:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
